26
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:31,520
and he got educated in the Netherlands, at Utrecht and has been at Philips research, Stanford national, NXP
他在荷兰乌得勒支接受教育，曾就职于飞利浦研究、斯坦福国家实验室和恩智浦。

27
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:36,480
before joining ASML, where he leads computational lithography efforts.
在加入阿斯麦之前，他负责计算光刻方面的研究工作。

